findings.remediation:
Add a terraform.tf at the module root declaring a version floor (a range, not an exact pin, since exact pins in a reusable module force that exact version on every consumer):

terraform {
  required_providers {
    google = {
      source  = "hashicorp/google"
      version = ">= 7.0.0"
    }
  }
  required_version = ">= 1.5.0"
}

